- Use a map `dp` where `dp[word]` = length of longest chain ending at `word`.
- For each word (in sorted order), for each position i, remove character at i to form `prev`. If `prev` exists in dp, `dp[word] = max(dp[word], dp[prev] + 1)`. Base case dp[word] = 1.
