This is the classic Word Ladder problem. Standard BFS approach:

1. Put wordList into a Set for O(1) lookup.
2. If endWord not in set, return 0.
3. BFS from beginWord, at each level try all possible single-letter transformations (26 letters × each position), check if in set, if so add to next level and remove from set.
4. Return level count when endWord found.

The number of words in the sequence = number of levels in BFS (starting with beginWord as level 1).

